{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011Cd51uaHsvWgW8EhZwYnJx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```dafny\n// CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN\n// Strategy: bounded GSM-symbolic answer generation using GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan.\n// When maxSteps == 0, return the input state unchanged at zero cost.\n// Otherwise, allocate half the step budget as an unconstrained preamble for\n// free-text chain-of-thought reasoning, then let the managed span helper\n// force entry into a parser-constrained answer span for the remaining budget.\n// A boost of 2.0 and narrow threshold of 3 are chosen to keep constrained\n// decoding decisive on a 2B model while still allowing soft preference.\n// CSD_RATIONALE_END\n\n// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_BEGIN\n// 1. parser_validity: insideConstrainedOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut)\n//    - maxSteps == 0 branch: insideConstrainedOut is set to insideConstrained and\n//      currentConstrainedOut to currentConstrained; the precondition\n//      insideConstrained ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrained) already holds,\n//      so the invariant is trivially preserved.\n//    - main branch: GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan's postcondition directly guarantees\n//      insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut), so assigning those return values\n//      preserves the invariant regardless of how many managed-step iterations ran.\n//\n// 2. progress: |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps, where steps tracks cost so far\n//    - maxSteps == 0 branch: generated := generatedPrefix, so |generated| == |generatedPrefix|\n//      and cost := 0 = maxSteps, satisfying the bound trivially.\n//    - main branch: GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan costs at most +maxSteps token-steps\n//      and its postcondition ensures |generatedOut| <= |generatedPrefix| + maxSteps;\n//      setting cost := maxSteps satisfies cost <= maxSteps.  Steps that produce EOS or\n//      rejected constraint suffixes still count toward the token budget but do not grow\n//      visible output, so visible length growth is always at most consumed budget.\n// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END\n\ngenerated            := generatedPrefix;\ninsideConstrainedOut := insideConstrained;\ncurrentConstrainedOut := currentConstrained;\ncost                 := 0;\n\nif maxSteps == 0 {\n  // cost == 0 <= 0 == maxSteps; all other postconditions hold from initialisation.\n} else {\n  var prefixBudget: nat := maxSteps / 2;\n  var g, i, c := helpers.GenerateWithPrefixAndManagedSpan(\n    lm, parser, prompt, generatedPrefix, insideConstrained, currentConstrained,\n    maxSteps, prefixBudget, validTokenGroups, 2.0, 3, eosToken);\n  generated             := g;\n  insideConstrainedOut  := i;\n  currentConstrainedOut := c;\n  cost                  := maxSteps;\n}\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10021,"cache_read_input_tokens":1145,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10021},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8598efe-858f-448f-84ce-05747fe2490d","uuid":"ec7febaa-db6d-42f4-bed7-587fc3d2d971","request_id":"req_011Cd51uZPoeojRcmG6Y1G4S"}
